  "description": "I just woke up after getting sick from overeating one day.\nBut now, I've realized my past life as a righteous K-Kid (with a Taekwondo poom belt).\n\n'And I have to save the world?!'\n\nI can totally do that!\n\nI'll start with the ill-mannered kids!\n\n\"It's not okay to talk so badly to your friends.\"\n\n\"What? Ha! What can a little pea like you do...\"\n\nI delivered a Hectopascal Kick, which I learned from Master Gyeonghye of the Taekwondo dojo.\n\n\"Aaargh!\"\n\n\"Don't be so rude!\"\n\nThat's right. The former K-Kid was strong (physically).\nVery strong.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68635587), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/K-%EC%9C%A0%EA%B5%90-%EC%96%B4%EB%A6%B0%EC%9D%B4%EA%B0%80-%EC%95%85%EB%8B%B9-%EA%B0%80%EC%A1%B1%EC%9D%84-%EA%B5%AC%ED%95%A8/4794) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/202279)",
